      "id": "sol.amc-8-1993-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(49 = 7 \\times 7\\) and \\(84 = 7 \\times 12,\\) the fraction reduces to \\(\\dfrac{7}{12}.\\)\n\nThe sum of numerator and denominator is \\(7 + 12 = 19.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C .",
      "hints": [
        "Find the greatest common factor of \\(49\\) and \\(84\\)",
        "\\(49 = 7^2\\) and \\(84 = 7 \\times 12,\\) so divide both by \\(7\\)"
